      "bodyMarkdown": "新冠疫苗依病毒株變化每年更新成分。2026–2027 年度疫苗依 WHO 建議株，自 **10 月 1 日**起開打，6 個月以上民眾皆可接種公費疫苗；65 歲以上長者、55 歲以上原住民、醫事人員、長照機構住民與工作人員、高風險慢性病人與孕婦為優先對象。\n\n可與流感疫苗同時分開部位接種，或間隔任何時間接種。",
      "precautions": "對疫苗成分曾發生嚴重過敏反應者不可接種。接種後少數人可能出現注射部位疼痛、疲倦、頭痛、發燒；若出現胸痛、心悸、呼吸急促，應立即就醫。",
      "whereUrl": "https://ancientsky.github.io/vaxmap-next/#g=covid",
      "i18n": {
        "en": {
          "title": "COVID-19 vaccine",
          "summary": "The 2026–27 COVID-19 vaccine starts on 1 October alongside flu vaccine: one government-funded dose for everyone aged 6 months and over; people 65+ and the immunocompromised may get another dose 6 months later.",
          "bodyMarkdown": "COVID-19 vaccines are updated each year as the virus changes. The 2026–27 vaccine follows WHO-recommended strains and is available from **1 October** for everyone aged 6 months and over; priority groups include adults 65+, indigenous people 55+, health workers, long-term care residents and staff, high-risk chronic patients and pregnant women.\n\nIt can be given with the flu vaccine in different sites, or at any interval."
        }
      },
