      "bodyMarkdown": "MMR 為活性減毒疫苗，完成 2 劑對麻疹的保護力約 97%。\n\n依 2025 年 4 月 16 日修訂的「國內現行 MMR 預防接種建議」，**1966 年（含）以後出生**、不具麻疹免疫力的成人，若計畫前往麻疹流行地區，建議出國前 2 至 4 週至旅遊醫學門診評估自費接種 1 劑。\n\n**醫護人員**（醫療照護工作人員）及經常接觸外國人的工作者（如機場、觀光、移工服務人員），也建議確認麻疹免疫力並評估接種。",
      "precautions": "孕婦及嚴重免疫不全者不可接種；育齡女性接種後 4 週內應避免懷孕。近期接受免疫球蛋白或輸血者需間隔一段時間再接種。",
      "whereUrl": "https://ancientsky.github.io/vaxmap-next/info.html#where",
      "i18n": {
        "en": {
          "title": "MMR vaccine (measles, mumps and rubella)",
          "summary": "MMR protects against measles, mumps and rubella. Children get one dose at 12 months and one between age 5 and school entry; adults born in 1966 or later without immunity should be assessed before travel.",
          "bodyMarkdown": "MMR is a live attenuated vaccine; two doses are about 97% effective against measles.\n\nUnder the recommendations revised on 16 April 2025, adults **born in 1966 or later** without measles immunity who plan to visit affected areas should see a travel clinic 2 to 4 weeks before departure to be assessed for one self-paid dose; health workers and people in frequent contact with foreign nationals should also be assessed."
        }
      },
